    "_postman_id": "737ed951-c51d-41cb-8740-3902ba84d88f",
    "name": "AWS VPN API (Amazon EC2 Query API subset) AWS VPN API (Amazon EC2 Query API Subset) AWS VPN API (Amazon EC2 Query API Subset) AWS VPN API (Amazon EC2 Query API Subset) API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "AWS Site-to-Site VPN and Client VPN operations exposed through the\nAmazon EC2 Query API. Manage VPN connections, customer gateways,\nvirtual private gateways, and Client VPN endpoints between\non-premises networks, remote users, and Amazon VPC.\nAll requests use HTTP POST with form-encoded query parameters\n(`Action=<Name>`) against the regional EC2 endpoint, signed with\nAWS Signature Version 4 (SigV4).\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Amazon Web Services",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
